\section{Conclusion}
COSE demonstrates real-time hybrid organism simulation with provable 
stability, heterogeneous hardware acceleration, and extreme-load 
resilience. This architecture establishes a new computational paradigm 
for biological modeling and multi-physics organism dynamics.

